      "speaker_id": "narrator",
      "badge_number": 2,
      "text": "He was not keeping the light sleep of a traveller who might wake at the snap of a twig. Yoganidra, the divine power of cosmic sleep, held him in profound stillness. His breathing alone gave measure to the immeasurable quiet.",
